+# S5-CLM-00003528
+
+Complete target-local dossier for the Borwein sine-series convergence claim.
+It binds frozen member `ATV-00003528` to Stage6 alias
+`S6-CLM-00003985` / `S6-VAR-00006196`, contains claim-owned Lean surfaces,
+semantic crosswalk and anchor ledgers, proof/readability DAGs, machine and
+release evidence, and the current worker validation receipt.
+
+The Formal Conjectures provider is statement provenance only: its theorem body
+contains a placeholder and is never used for proof closure.  This worker runs
+only the authorized `--no-lean` preflight.  Canonical trust-zero compilation
+and acceptance are deliberately left to the Master.
